4  Study 1: system performance
In Study 1, we conduct a preliminary experiment to evaluate the performance of the system before conducting user study. The goal of Study 1 is to determine: 1) whether the 3DCAR algorithm works well in a FARS vehicle, and 2) the difference in performance of the FARS system when using GPS and RTK devices. The experiment was conducted by

